OL,3,APolls about to close in pivotal Israeli
OL,4,Aelection after high voter turnout
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere's been very high turnout in
OL,7,FIsrael's pivotal general election, with
OL,8,Fpolls about to close
OL,10,FVoting is due to stop at 22:00 local
OL,11,Ftime (20:00 GMT) - but those already in
OL,12,Fline will still be able to cast their
OL,13,Fballot
OL,15,FIt is Israel's first legislative
OL,16,Felection since the Hamas-led attacks on
OL,17,F7 October 2023. All 120 seats in the
OL,18,FKnesset, Israel's parliament, are up
OL,19,Ffor grabs
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
